# FlyRank Capstone Configuration

## Tech Stack
- Framework: Next.js (App Router)
- Language: TypeScript
- Styling: Tailwind CSS

## Learned AI Directing Rules
1. Client Component Enforcement: Always verify that interactive components using React hooks explicitly include the `'use client'` directive at the top of the file.
2. Accessible Form Controls: All form controls generated by AI must include explicitly bound `<label>` elements and `role="alert"` attributes for dynamic errors.
3. Schema Validation: Prefer schema-based validation (Zod) over raw state or native HTML attributes for input gating.